  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shi Lei names the walking meat tree an ancient desolate plant of legend after fighting it near the eighth star hall.",
      "chapters": [
        721
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "walking-meat-tree-encounter",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_lei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan regrets missing the walking meat tree: as an ancient desolate plant of legend it can sell for a higher price than the astral wind flying heavenly boar’s ancient desolate beast corpse.",
      "chapters": [
        729
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "walking-meat-tree-encounter",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Fairy Li Shan’s immortal aperture, lush forests hold large numbers of precious materials, a small number of desolate plants, and ancient desolate plants.",
      "chapters": [
        871
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "habitat-and-recognition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside a vast space path Gu formation, Fang Yuan finds many ancient desolate plants and desolate beasts he cannot name despite his knowledge.",
      "chapters": [
        935
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "habitat-and-recognition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Treasure yellow heaven sells books on ancient desolate plants alongside desolate beast encyclopedias and regional maps.",
      "chapters": [
        1116
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "habitat-and-recognition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After sword lights tear Falling Heavenly River, Fairy Bai Qing picks up beast corpses and the branches and roots of ancient desolate plants and immemorial desolate plants. She treats those gathers as excellent Gu refinement materials before more beasts force her to retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        957
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "practical-uses",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_falling_heavenly_river",
        "char_fairy_bai_qing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Lord Bai Zu sends ancient desolate plants into Hei Fan grotto-heaven with their roots in the soil, turning terrain into temporary camps for his beasts.",
      "chapters": [
        1173
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "practical-uses",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu",
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A giant disaster blazing tree is an ancient desolate plant once common in immemorial red heaven and still rarely seen in the five regions. It can form from any tree when a forest fire kills countless lifeforms; its body burns endlessly, nothing can approach it, and lifeforms near it suffer bad luck.",
      "chapters": [
        1113
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "category-examples",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Guang faces a yellow ginseng whose struck trunk was only a larger branch of the whole plant. He judges it an ancient desolate plant with tens of thousands of years of history, very close to rank eight and at the peak of an ancient desolate plant.",
      "chapters": [
        2167
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "category-examples",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_guang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Soul search of Hei Fan grotto-heaven locals shows areas where ancient desolate beasts and ancient desolate plants live, besides forbidden grounds.",
      "chapters": [
        1132
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-fan-habitat-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among those ancient desolate plants is a walking meat tree, a rare strength path plant that usually grows in black heaven. Hei Fan enclosed part of the grotto-heaven in darkness and built a habitat around it; Fang Yuan relocates that tree into Mini Black Heaven, where the environment suits it without the same arrangements. Hei Fan’s methods also make relocating other ancient desolate plants easy.",
      "chapters": [
        1133
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-fan-habitat-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_fan",
        "loc_mini_black_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After absorbing Hei Fan grotto-heaven resources, the sovereign immortal aperture holds desolate plants and one ancient desolate plant: the walking meat tree.",
      "chapters": [
        1148
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-fan-habitat-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ancient desolate beasts and ancient desolate plants lack intelligence, are easily influenced by heaven’s will, and can form into a giant beast tide, which is why Fang Yuan will not undergo tribulation in Tai Qiu.",
      "chapters": [
        1183
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-tide-fodder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_ancient_desolate_beast",
        "loc_tai_qiu"
      ]
    }
  ],
